OL,3,GNEWSATraders' relief at end of town's
OL,4,Atwo-year roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Holmfirth prepares to host its first
OL,7,Fmajor event since the completion of a
OL,8,Fseries of town centre roadworks which
OL,9,Flasted just over two years, business
OL,10,Fowners have said they can finally
OL,11,Fbreathe a sigh of relief.
OL,13,FWork on the Holmfirth Town Centre
OL,14,FAccess Plan, which involved closing
OL,15,Froads both to vehicles and pedestrians,
OL,16,Fbegan in July 2024 and only finished at
OL,17,Fthe end of last month.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
