OL,3,GNEWSATraders' relief at end of town's
OL,4,Atwo-year roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeng Yau Lim, the owner of Poppa
OL,7,FPiccolino for the past 21 years, said
OL,8,Fhe welcomed the end of the disruption
OL,9,Fand felt the project had finished just
OL,10,Fin time.
OL,12,F"If it did not complete last week, if
OL,13,Fit had carried on until next year, we
OL,14,Fwould have shut shop because it has
OL,15,Fbeen really, really tough," he said.
